OL,3,GNEWSAAdverse weather may prolong
OL,4,Avillage road closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanned road closures set to bring
OL,7,Fdisruption to the main route through a
OL,8,Fvillage could last longer if weather
OL,9,Fconditions worsen, council chiefs have
OL,10,Fwarned.
OL,12,FWork is set to start on Monday to
OL,13,Fresurface pavements in St Bees, west
OL,14,FCumbria, with round-the-clock closures
OL,15,Fplanned for at least two weeks.
OL,17,FBut Cumberland Council said the work
OL,18,Falong the B5345 Main Street and
OL,19,FEgremont Road may carry on beyond that
OL,20,Fdepending on weather conditions.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
