OL,3,GNEWSAAdverse weather may prolong
OL,4,Avillage road closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the closures will be in place
OL,7,Fround the clock, access will be
OL,8,Fpermitted for residents between 18:00
OL,9,FGMT and 06:00 and at weekends, but only
OL,10,Fwhere it is deemed possible.
